WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:03.220
George: From calorie
count to portion sizes,

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:05.130
we wanted to find out all the differences

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:08.050
between Taco Bell in Japan and the US.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:09.946
This is "Food Wars."

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:16.061
In Japan, Taco Bell's standard tacos

00:00:16.061 --> 00:00:18.577
come in orders of one,

00:00:18.577 --> 00:00:23.150
two tacos with fries and a drink,

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:26.550
or you can get five-pack,

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:29.770
or you can get 10-pack.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:31.510
In the US, our standard Taco Bell tacos

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:33.176
come in orders of one,

00:00:33.176 --> 00:00:34.567
three with a medium drink,

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:38.920
or this, the 12-taco party pack.

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.530
Check this out.

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:42.020
I mean, they're not kidding
when they say this is a party.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.740
You roll into any party with this,

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:47.080
you are the party winner, right?

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.820
So, this is a Beef Taco Supreme.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:51.530
It measures 5 inches.

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:52.438
Our Beef Taco Supreme

00:00:52.438 --> 00:00:54.596
that's falling apart 'cause I'm an idiot

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:58.842
is exactly 5 3/4 inches.

00:00:58.842 --> 00:01:00.500
And let's weigh this.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.176
And it weighs ...

00:01:02.176 --> 00:01:03.690
Boom!

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:06.272
It weighs 100 grams.

00:01:06.272 --> 00:01:08.270
Looks like about 120 grams.

00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:11.955
And this one is our burrito in Japan.

00:01:11.955 --> 00:01:13.430
Now let's measure it.

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:14.860
5 inches.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:16.851
Our bean burrito is

00:01:16.851 --> 00:01:20.820
6 3/8 inches long.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:23.010
And it weighs ...

00:01:23.010 --> 00:01:23.951
guh!

00:01:23.951 --> 00:01:26.410
It weighs 220 grams.

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:29.380
Just a hair over 250 grams.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:32.100
Yeah, ours weighs more!

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:34.080
Hooray!

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:36.800
Here's our Crunchwrap Supreme.

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:39.630
It measures 6 inches across.

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:41.968
Let's go. Boom!

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:44.860
It weighs exactly 250 grams.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:48.000
A personal favorite,
the Crunchwrap Supr --

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.546
oh, man!

00:01:49.546 --> 00:01:51.810
Aww, guys!

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:53.310
I mean, you get the idea, but it's just,

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:54.460
it's just like a thing of beauty

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.560
when they have the whole
thing folded properly.

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:58.774
Plus also now, all my ...

00:01:58.774 --> 00:02:00.238
everything inside's kind of exposed.

00:02:00.238 --> 00:02:03.904
Across, it's exactly

00:02:03.904 --> 00:02:05.755
6 inches.

00:02:05.755 --> 00:02:06.590
Eh?

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:08.310
Illuminati stuff coming at you.

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:10.380
Six sides, 6 inches.

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:14.350
Oh, [beep].

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:17.010
We're on to them. Here they come.

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:18.493
If we go point to point,

00:02:18.493 --> 00:02:23.300
it is the less interesting 6 1/2 inches.

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:24.575
So, we'll weigh it.

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.520
You have no idea how bad

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:29.625
I just want to take a huge
bite out of this thing.

00:02:29.625 --> 00:02:32.890
It weighs a respectable 300 grams.

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:35.236
That to me sounds exactly right.

00:02:35.236 --> 00:02:37.097
At the Japanese Taco Bell,

00:02:37.097 --> 00:02:39.597
