So, these are our Japan-only drinks.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:26.570
We've got Coke and Coke Zero.

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:28.523
Drinks!

00:12:28.523 --> 00:12:30.020
Sip, sip, baby!

